ize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>35</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_NC_PHASING</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ equivalent to: PLCopen MC_Phasing                                           ]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>36</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_NC_TOUCH_PROBE</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ equivalent to: PLCOpen MC_TouchProbe                                        ]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>38</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_NC_ABORT_TRIGGER</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ equivalent to: PLCOpen MC_AbortTrigger                                      ]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>39</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_NC_DRIVE_INSTRUCTION</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ equivalent to: PLCopen MC_WriteLrealParameter                               ]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>93</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_NC_OPERATION_MODE</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ equivalent to: PLCopen SetDriveMode                                         ]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>97</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_NC_AXIS_INIT_POS</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ equivalent to: MCV_InitPosition                                             ]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>115</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_NC_MCV_RUN_DOWN</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Axis specific command to run down a spindle; vendor specific function MCV_RunDown. ]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>163</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_SPDL_NEG_DREHR</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Drehrichtung negativ ]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><Default><Value>0</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_JOB_NOT_ACKN</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ No job acknowledge available                                                ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>0</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_JOB_ABORTED</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Job was aborted                                                             ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>1</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_JOB_DONE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Job was carried out                                                         ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>2</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_JOB_ERROR</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Job was not carried out because of error                                    ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>3</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_JOB_ACKN_BLOCKED</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Job acknowledge can't be written to HLI                                     ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>4</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_MEAS_SIG_DEF_EDGE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ default edge (from axis parameter list)                                     ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>0</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_MEAS_SIGNAL_LOW_ACTIVE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ measure signal is low active                                                ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>1</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_MEAS_SIGNAL_HIGH_ACTIVE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ measure signal is high active                                               ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>2</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_ACTIVATE_PROBE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ ! OBSOLETE - for new implementations use HLI_EXT_LATCH_ENABLE_PROBE  !      ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>1</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_DEACTIVATE_PROBE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ ! OBSOLETE - for new implementations use HLI_EXT_LATCH_DISABLE_PROBE !      ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>2</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_EXT_LATCH_ENABLE_PROBE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ enable probing hardware, start of measuring.                                ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>1</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_EXT_LATCH_DISABLE_PROBE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ deactivate probing hardware, end of measuring or abortion.                  ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>2</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_EXT_LATCH_PREPARE_PROBE</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ turn on probing hardware, at start of measuring                             ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>3</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">ABORT_ALL_MEASURE_ORDERS</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ ID in abort touch probe command to abort all open measure orders            ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>4294967295</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_STEP_DIRECT</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ constant positions are taken out of the cam table (staircase signal)        ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>0</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_LINEAR</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ slave position are linear interpolated between two cam table entries        ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>1</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_