[CDATA[ only for PLCopen compatibility. Absolute table data are always assumed      ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>2</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_CI_RELATIVE</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ only for PLCopen compatibility. Relative table data are not supported       ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>4</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_CI_LOCK_TABLE</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Table Lock Mode when CamIn                                                  ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>8</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_CI_F_PERIODIC</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ ISG supports f_periodic also for CamIn (PLCopen only for Table select)      ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>16</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_CI_ENDLESS_POSITIVE</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ automatic correction of spe[i] at moduloborder for interpolated fkt-types   ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>32</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_CI_ENDLESS_NEGATIVE</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ automatic correction of spe[i] at moduloborder for interpolated fkt-types   ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>64</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_CGI_CPL_TO_CUR_VALUES</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ slave coupling for camming, gearing to current master values                ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>128</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_GI_GEAR_IN_POS</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ gear in with position phasing                                               ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>256</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">HLI_TS_PERIODIC</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ default 